{"YOU|0|If anything walks into that, I'll hear it.":["intro",0,16797,2760],"YOU|0|Someone's following me. It's me. A few seconds behind.":["late",0,23277,3840],"RHEA|1|Don't look at it too long.":["late",23277,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|The signal's so strong here I can hear my own heartbeat in it.":["late",32298,20973,3456],"YOU|0|Rhea, the rocks are floating.":["late",53271,12045,1968],"RHEA|1|Of course they are. Why wouldn't they be.":["late",65316,13629,2232],"HOLLOW|0|The one walks north! Stop the one!":["late",78945,19389,3192],"RHEA|1|{name}, there's a light ahead of you. White. My whole screen's just white.":["late",98334,24861,4104],"YOU|0|I'm walking into it.":["late",123195,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|I know. I think I've always known you would.":["late",132504,14781,2424],"YOU|0|Rhea. Did you know?":["intro",16797,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|Not all of it.":["intro",26106,7005,1128],"YOU|0|How much of it?":["intro",33111,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|Later. I swear, later.":["intro",42132,10029,1632],"RHEA|1|Go back to the ambulance. There's a medkit in the side locker, and I want you near something with walls.":["intro",52161,34221,5664],"YOU|0|Black box. It's still got power. There's a recording.":["intro",86382,21261,3504],"PILOT|1|This is Captain Daniel Okafor. Final log. If you're hearing this, we didn't make it.":["intro",107643,35805,5928],"PILOT|1|Meridian lied to us. That light opened the second our patient's heart rate spiked.":["intro",143448,34509,5712],"PILOT|1|Reyes is gone. I looked away for one second and his seat was empty.":["intro",177957,28893,4776],"PILOT|1|Vance is in the back with the patient. If anyone finds this, keep them away from the towers. Please.":["intro",206850,41853,6936],"YOU|0|Stones round it. It'll hold the heat now.":["intro",248703,17661,2904],"YOU|0|Somewhere to keep things. Somewhere that stays put.":["intro",266364,19821,3264],"YOU|0|A roof. More or less.":["intro",286185,10605,1728],"YOU|0|First time it's felt like I'm staying.":["intro",296790,14493,2376],"YOU|0|Clean cloth. Needle. Everything laid out in the right order.":["intro",311283,24861,4104],"YOU|0|I don't remember learning the right order.":["intro",336144,14493,2376],"YOU|0|Rhea. Is that better?":["intro",350637,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|Clear as anything. What did you do?":["intro",360522,12333,2016],"YOU|0|Built a radio out of a broken one.":["intro",372855,15933,2616],"YOU|0|Everything I've found, in one place.":["intro",388788,15069,2472],"YOU|0|Some of these pencil marks were here already. Same hand as mine.":["intro",403857,27309,4512],"YOU|0|Still there?":["intro",431166,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Still here. Still no planes.":["intro",438315,11181,1824],"RHEA|1|You sound closer when you're at your fire. I know that's not how radios work.":["intro",449496,25581,4224],"YOU|0|Talk to me about anything.":["intro",475077,11037,1800],"RHEA|1|There's a song stuck in my head and I can't remember a single word of it.":["intro",486114,24429,4032],"RHEA|1|Keep the fire high tonight. I don't know why I said tonight. It's always tonight.":["intro",510543,26877,4440],"RHEA|1|You went quiet. Are you all right?":["story",0,12045,1968],"YOU|0|It's my second day too.":["story",12045,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|What?":["story",23802,4989,792],"YOU|0|Nothing. I'm coming back.":["story",28791,10605,1728],"YOU|0|It's pointed at the crash.":["story",39396,11037,1800],"YOU|0|Somebody's been watching us.":["story",50433,12045,1968],"YOU|0|It started recording at two fifty-one.":["story",62478,15645,2568],"YOU|0|We came down at twelve minutes past three.":["story",78123,16941,2784],"ECHO|0|Second day. It walked round my fire in the night. All the way round.":["story",95064,23277,3840],"ECHO|0|It isn't hunting me. Hunting would be quicker.":["story",118341,16365,2688],"ECHO|0|It wants to know where I go. So I stopped going anywhere.":["story",134706,19821,3264],"ECHO|0|If you can hear this, you made a fire too.":["story",154527,14349,2352],"YOU|0|It's behind me. It isn't trying to catch up.":["story",168876,19101,3144],"RHEA|1|Then what's it doing?":["story",187977,8013,1296],"YOU|0|Seeing where I go.":["story",195990,9309,1512],"YOU|0|I walked right past here this morning.":["story",205299,14637,2400],"HOLLOW|0|Again.":["story",219936,8013,1296],"RHEA|0|Over here. Quickly.":["story",227949,9741,1584],"YOU|0|Rhea? Where are you?":["story",237690,9597,1560],"RHEA|1|Where I always am. On the radio.":["story",247287,13197,2160],"YOU|0|I just heard you. Out there, in the trees.":["story",260484,17229,2832],"RHEA|1|That wasn't me.":["story",277713,7005,1128],"RHEA|1|There you are. Listen, I went back through the transfer logs. Your flight was never\u2014":["story",284718,28029,4632],"YOU|0|Rhea?":["story",312747,5565,888],"YOU|0|Rhea. Say something.":["story",318312,9597,1560],"YOU|0|Prints. All the way round the fire.":["story",327909,13629,2232],"RHEA|1|An animal?":["story",341538,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Bare feet. It stopped every few steps. Like it was listening.":["story",347967,25725,4248],"YOU|0|Then it went that way.":["story",373692,9741,1584],"RHEA|1|That's toward the Blackwood. Don't.":["story",383433,12621,2064],"YOU|0|It knows where I sleep. I want to know where it goes.":["story",396054,21981,3624],"YOU|0|That's not her.":["story",418035,8589,1392],"YOU|0|It's close. It's coming from out there.":["story",426624,14349,2352],"RHEA|1|Can you hear me? Please. Say anything.":["story",440973,13773,2256],"YOU|0|I'm here.":["story",454746,7005,1128],"RHEA|1|You were gone four hours. Everything went dead. What happened?":["story",461751,20541,3384],"YOU|0|Somebody filmed the crash, Rhea. From before it happened.":["story",482292,22413,3696],"RHEA|1|That's not possible.":["story",504705,8589,1392],"YOU|0|Then somebody knew.":["story",513294,9597,1560],"RHEA|1|There are towers north of you. Old ones. Your signal's riding on something up there. If anyone's listening, that's where from.":["story",522891,43005,7128],"RHEA|1|{name}. About Ines.":["late",147285,9885,1608],"YOU|0|She said you dropped her off.":["late",157170,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|I've flown forty transfers. I talked every one of them down. I told myself they were going somewhere better.":["late",168927,37677,6240],"YOU|0|Were they?":["late",206604,6861,1104],"RHEA|1|I never asked. That was the job. Not asking.":["late",213465,17085,2808],"YOU|0|I'm keeping it. If it's a key, I want to know what it opens.":["late",230550,22701,3744],"TEO|0|Everyone says that.":["late",253251,12045,1968],"INES|0|Not everyone gets to be right.":["late",265296,12333,2016],"YOU|0|{name}. Not ten thousand and one. Just {name}.":["late",277629,22557,3720],"TEO|0|Then the fire's yours, whenever you want it.":["late",300186,20829,3432],"INES|0|You're still going north.":["late",321015,10029,1632],"YOU|0|I'm still going north.":["late",331044,11037,1800],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one. Again.":["late",342081,28749,4752],"CHOIR|0|{name}. Again.":["late",370830,15789,2592],"YOU|0|Stones. Kindling. Dry wood.":["late",386619,13197,2160],"YOU|0|Right next to where I woke up.":["late",399816,12765,2088],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one.":["late",412581,22989,3792],"CHOIR|0|{name}. You came with a name. You are the first who did.":["late",435570,32925,5448],"CHOIR|0|Meridian opened the door ten thousand times. The ten thousand and first time, the door opened itself.":["late",468495,73101,12144],"YOU|0|Why?":["late",541596,5565,888],"CHOIR|0|Because you were already on this side.":["late",547161,24861,4104],"YOU|0|Who are you?":["late",572022,8301,1344],"CHOIR|0|The ones who didn't forget. Every one of us walked in here. Every one of us was you.":["late",580323,57261,9504],"YOU|0|Then what happens now?":["late",637584,10029,1632],"CHOIR|0|Someone has to be waiting when you fall. Someone has to build the fire. Someone has to write it down.":["late",647613,69069,11472],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Flight, the fourteenth of March.":["late",716682,26589,4392],"YOU|0|It was my handwriting. The whole time.":["late",743271,16797,2760],"RHEA|1|{name}? I can't see you anymore. Everything's gone white.":["late",760068,19533,3216],"YOU|0|Rhea. You told me nobody was going anywhere tonight.":["late",779601,21549,3552],"RHEA|1|When did I say that?":["late",801150,8733,1416],"YOU|0|You will.":["late",809883,6573,1056],"RHEA|1|Then come back to me.":["late",816456,8733,1416],"YOU|0|Every time.":["late",825189,8157,1320],"PILOT|1|Meridian Control, Medevac Two Six. Level three one zero. Cargo's asleep. Crew's awake. Mostly.":["intro",537420,46029,7632],"DEZ|0|Mostly?":["intro",583449,5421,864],"PILOT|0|You've checked that fuel gauge nine times, Reyes.":["intro",588870,21405,3528],"DEZ|0|It's my first black-site run, Captain. I'm allowed nine.":["intro",610275,19533,3216],"PILOT|0|It's a hospital transfer.":["intro",629808,12333,2016],"DEZ|0|Hospitals don't pay triple. And they don't make you sign an NDA in the parking lot.":["intro",642141,30621,5064],"PILOT|0|Fair.":["intro",672762,6285,1008],"RHEA|1|Cabin to cockpit. Are you two done gossiping? My patient's trying to sleep.":["intro",679047,26589,4392],"PILOT|1|Your patient's sedated, Vance.":["intro",705636,14925,2448],"RHEA|0|Mm. Then explain why their heart rate just jumped to one forty.":["intro",720561,23421,3864],"DEZ|0|Is that bad? That sounds bad.":["intro",743982,10749,1752],"RHEA|1|In someone this sedated? It means they're having one hell of a dream.":["intro",754731,23997,3960],"RHEA|0|Hey, sleeper. It's Rhea again. Whatever you're dreaming about, you can let it go.":["intro",778728,26013,4296],"RHEA|0|I've got you. Nobody's going anywhere tonight.":["intro",804741,16941,2784],"DEZ|0|Captain. Twelve o'clock. Is that a storm?":["intro",821682,13629,2232],"PILOT|0|Storms don't glow like that.":["intro",835311,13629,2232],"DEZ|0|It's opening. Why is it opening?":["intro",848940,11037,1800],"PILOT|0|Autopilot off. Hard left, now.":["intro",859977,17373,2856],"DEZ|0|She's not answering! Everything's dead, the controls are dead!":["intro",877350,19965,3288],"RHEA|0|Captain, talk to me!":["intro",897315,9309,1512],"PILOT|1|Vance, strap in. Strap the patient in!":["intro",906624,18381,3024],"RHEA|0|Already done. Sleeper, hold on to me. Hold on.":["intro",925005,19101,3144],"PILOT|0|Mayday, mayday, Medevac Two Six. We're going in. God help whoever's down there.":["intro",944106,34653,5736],"HOLLOW|0|Count it.":["intro",978759,8157,1320],"HOLLOW|0|Ten thousand.":["intro",986916,11181,1824],"HOLLOW|0|No. Count again.":["intro",998097,12621,2064],"HOLLOW|0|Ten thousand. And one.":["intro",1010718,16797,2760],"YOU|0|They're going back into the trees.":["intro",1027515,12333,2016],"RHEA|1|Sun's coming up. Or whatever that is. Come back to the fire.":["intro",1039848,21117,3480],"RHEA|1|Sun's up. Or whatever that is. You made it, {name}.":["night",0,18381,3024],"RHEA|1|Dawn. I could hear you fighting from here. Rest.":["night",18381,16797,2760],"YOU|0|Still here.":["night",35178,7005,1128],"RHEA|1|Still here.":["night",42183,6141,984],"RHEA|1|That's another night. I'm marking them on my arm.":["night",48324,16797,2760],"RHEA|1|It's gone very quiet where you are.":["intro",1060965,11757,1920],"YOU|0|It isn't quiet. Something keeps walking just past the light.":["intro",1072722,23997,3960],"RHEA|1|Then don't leave the light.":["intro",1096719,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|You're in the dark part of the woods. Your signal's going.":["intro",1106028,18093,2976],"YOU|0|There's something out here worth finding.":["intro",1124121,14061,2304],"RHEA|1|There's always something out there. Be quick.":["intro",1138182,14781,2424],"ECHO|0|Patient seven. Day one. They said it was a clinical trial. They said I'd be home by spring.":["echo",0,32781,5424],"ECHO|0|Four twelve. The shards sing when you're close to the towers. Don't sing back.":["echo",32781,25725,4248],"ECHO|0|Eleven twenty three. I forgot my daughter's name today. I wrote it on my arm. Now I can't read my own handwriting.":["echo",58506,43581,7224],"ECHO|0|Twenty thirty one. The masks aren't for war. They're so we don't have to see who we used to be.":["echo",102087,33213,5496],"ECHO|0|Thirty three forty four. Meridian sends one of us through every few days. Like feeding something.":["echo",135300,32781,5424],"ECHO|0|Forty three eighty two. They'll list me as missing. I'm not missing. The Warden was kind once. He taught me how to make fire.":["echo",168081,44445,7368],"ECHO|0|Fifty sixty three. There's a voice on the radio every time one of us falls. Warm. Funny. Calls herself Rhea.":["echo",212526,37965,6288],"ECHO|0|Sixty seventy one. Fall. Forget. Belong. It isn't a prayer. It's a set of instructions.":["echo",250491,30909,5112],"ECHO|0|Seventy two ninety one. Transferred, they'll say. The second moon is closer every night. I measured it with my thumb.":["echo",281400,46029,7632],"ECHO|0|Ninety eight forty three. If you're the last one, listen. The door doesn't lead home. Home is what it eats.":["echo",327429,33501,5544],"ECHO|0|Ten thousand. There was a fire pit by the wreck when I landed. Already built. Like somebody knew. I kept it lit. Whoever you are, keep it lit.":["echo",360930,50637,8400],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. {name}. If you're hearing this, it's already happened. I've done this before. Many times.":["echo",411567,40269,6672],"YOU|0|I built the fire. I carried the case to it. I wrote us into the book, so you'd know you were expected.":["echo",451836,39405,6528],"YOU|0|Stop counting the nights. Start counting the people. Find Rhea.":["echo",491241,25437,4200],"RHEA|1|{name}? Who were you talking to?":["echo",516678,11757,1920],"YOU|0|Me.":["echo",528435,5565,888],"RHEA|1|{name}? Your signal just doubled. Like there are two of you standing there.":["echo",534000,24717,4080],"RHEA|1|Hey, sleeper. It's Rhea again. Whatever you're dreaming about, you can let it go.":["late",833346,25725,4248],"RHEA|1|I've got you. Nobody's going anywhere tonight.":["late",859071,16797,2760],"YOU|0|I know.":["late",875868,8301,1344],"RHEA|1|Sleeper?":["late",884169,6141,984],"RHEA|1|{name}, the signal's through! But it's not going home. Something on the other side is pulling it.":["story",565896,31341,5184],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one. We counted every fall. You are the one we did not count.":["story",597237,60861,10104],"CHOIR|0|Come and see.":["story",658098,16077,2640],"RHEA|1|Don't you dare go anywhere without me.":["story",674175,12189,1992],"YOU|0|Someone built a fire pit. Stones, kindling, dry wood. Right next to where I woke up.":["intro",1152963,37533,6216],"RHEA|1|Then light it. Whatever's out there, I'd rather it saw you from far away than up close.":["intro",1190496,28749,4752],"RHEA|1|Better. I can see your smoke from here.":["intro",1219245,12765,2088],"YOU|0|There's a case by the stones. Meridian. Somebody carried it here from the wreck.":["intro",1232010,29901,4944],"RHEA|1|Don't open that. {name}, those files aren't for":["intro",1261911,17085,2808],"YOU|0|It's already open.":["intro",1278996,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|The fire's dying! Get back to it!":["night",65121,13197,2160],"YOU|0|It's out. I need something that burns.":["intro",1288881,15933,2616],"TEO|0|Sit. The fire doesn't ask questions.":["late",890310,19821,3264],"TEO|0|Meridian thinks it's a door. It isn't. It's a mouth. And it's always hungry.":["late",910131,33645,5568],"INES|0|And sometimes it spits us back out. Changed. Alive. It's a door, Teo. Doors go both ways.":["late",943776,31341,5184],"TEO|0|Everyone who wants to go home walks north into the Basin. Nobody walks back.":["late",975117,32925,5448],"INES|0|Because nobody's tried it with a key.":["late",1008042,12909,2112],"RHEA|1|{name}, listen to me. Meridian has a pickup at the heart of the Basin. That's what the towers were for. I can get you out. I just need you there.":["late",1020951,51213,8496],"TEO|0|Your radio woman. Ask her what happens to the ones she picks up.":["late",1072164,28461,4704],"RHEA|1|I don't know. I never asked.":["late",1100625,11181,1824],"TEO|0|Leave your band on the wall. Stay. Be a person here instead of a number out there.":["late",1111806,33789,5592],"INES|0|Or keep it, walk north, and find out what the number's for.":["late",1145595,18237,3000],"HOLLOW|0|Room four. Don't close it. Don't close the door.":["intro",1304814,23853,3936],"YOU|0|It's wearing a wristband. Twenty two ninety one.":["intro",1328667,20685,3408],"RHEA|1|That one says terminated.":["intro",1349352,10029,1632],"YOU|0|Then why was it walking?":["intro",1359381,10893,1776],"RHEA|1|You're back.":["intro",1370274,5853,936],"YOU|0|You knew I'd make it.":["intro",1376127,10317,1680],"RHEA|1|I knew where you'd come back from.":["intro",1386444,10317,1680],"YOU|0|It's warm. And it's humming.":["intro",1396761,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|My scanner just jumped off the chart. Not near me. Near you. Keep it. Keep all of them.":["intro",1408518,32637,5400],"YOU|0|Rhea. Someone's standing in the trees.":["intro",1441155,14493,2376],"RHEA|1|Say again?":["intro",1455648,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Nothing. They're gone.":["intro",1462077,9309,1512],"HOLLOW|0|Visiting hours are over.":["common",0,17373,2856],"HOLLOW|0|Is it Tuesday? It feels like Tuesday.":["common",17373,21549,3552],"HOLLOW|0|Take your medicine.":["common",38922,11613,1896],"HOLLOW|0|Fall. Forget. Belong.":["common",50535,16797,2760],"HOLLOW|0|I had a name. I had a name!":["common",67332,18093,2976],"HOLLOW|0|Don't look at the moons.":["common",85425,13773,2256],"HOLLOW|0|Count it! Ten thousand!":["common",99198,16509,2712],"HOLLOW|0|Lights out. Lights out!":["common",115707,15069,2472],"HOLLOW|0|Nurse? Nurse!":["common",130776,10893,1776],"HOLLOW|0|Room four. Room four.":["common",141669,17229,2832],"HOLLOW|0|Mom?":["common",158898,7293,1176],"HOLLOW|0|Don't close it!":["common",166191,10173,1656],"HOLLOW|0|And one. And one.":["common",176364,14349,2352],"INES|0|Don't swing. I'm not one of them.":["late",1163832,11325,1848],"YOU|0|You've got a wristband.":["late",1175157,9885,1608],"INES|0|Forty three eighty two. They wrote me down as missing. I wasn't missing. I was busy.":["late",1185042,26877,4440],"INES|0|You put the Warden down. Do you know what that means?":["late",1211919,16509,2712],"YOU|0|That he stops trying to kill me?":["late",1228428,12765,2088],"INES|0|It means nobody's standing in the door. Everything out here is going to come and look.":["late",1241193,27741,4584],"RHEA|1|{name}, I've got two signals on you. One of them's wrong. It's too bright.":["late",1268934,25149,4152],"INES|0|Tell her Ines says hello. She'll remember me. She's the one who dropped me off.":["late",1294083,24717,4080],"RHEA|1|Ines?":["late",1318800,5853,936],"INES|0|There are people in the deep woods. Living ones. Keep the red light on your right and walk until the trees go black. I'll have the fire going.":["late",1324653,45453,7536],"YOU|0|Rhea. I died. I felt it.":["night",78318,12765,2088],"RHEA|1|What? You're right here, {name}. You never left the fire.":["night",91083,18381,3024],"YOU|0|Then why do I remember the dark?":["night",109464,13773,2256],"YOU|0|Same moons. Same smoke. Same fire.":["night",123237,17661,2904],"RHEA|1|{name}, you're scaring me.":["night",140898,10173,1656],"YOU|0|Good. Stay scared. It keeps you alive.":["night",151071,15789,2592],"RHEA|1|Sleeper? Tap the radio if you can hear me. Anything.":["night",166860,18813,3096],"YOU|0|I know. I always know what you're going to say.":["night",185673,17949,2952],"RHEA|1|Then tell me how tonight ends.":["night",203622,10461,1704],"YOU|0|Differently.":["night",214083,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Again. The shards remember. So do I.":["night",221088,17085,2808],"YOU|0|Somebody's cut a mark into this tree.":["intro",1471386,15069,2472],"YOU|0|It's fresh.":["intro",1486455,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Wristbands on the stones by the fire. Mine. More of them every time.":["night",238173,30333,5016],"YOU|0|That cairn wasn't here last time.":["night",268506,13917,2280],"RHEA|1|Last time?":["night",282423,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Never mind.":["night",289284,7869,1272],"RHEA|1|{name}, the mast light's out. I can't find you without it.":["night",297153,20397,3360],"YOU|0|Then I'll find you.":["night",317550,9165,1488],"YOU|0|There's a page by the fire. The registry. My line.":["night",326715,21693,3576],"RHEA|1|Is the ink":["night",348408,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Still wet.":["night",355413,7149,1152],"YOU|0|Someone at the edge of the light again.":["night",362562,13917,2280],"RHEA|1|Same one?":["night",376479,6285,1008],"YOU|0|I think it's always the same one.":["night",382764,13197,2160],"RHEA|1|They've stopped at the edge of the light. Why have they stopped?":["night",395961,18381,3024],"YOU|0|They're waiting to see if I remember.":["night",414342,14781,2424],"CHOIR|0|Again.":["night",429123,14781,2424],"YOU|0|That tree was standing yesterday. Or whenever yesterday was.":["night",443904,24429,4032],"YOU|0|I understand it now. It isn't punishing me. It's waiting for me to build the fire.":["night",468333,33501,5544],"RHEA|1|Then build it. I'll be on the radio. I'm always on the radio.":["night",501834,22269,3672],"RHEA|0|Sleeper? Over here.":["night",524103,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|{name}, that wasn't me. I didn't say anything. I swear I didn't say anything.":["night",535860,27453,4536],"RHEA|1|The wreck's ahead of you. Follow the smoke.":["common",190713,13917,2280],"RHEA|1|Head back to the ambulance. Keep the dead tree behind you.":["common",204630,20973,3456],"RHEA|1|The fire pit's by the ambulance. Look for the stones.":["common",225603,19101,3144],"RHEA|1|The case. It's by the stones, where the fire is.":["common",244704,16797,2760],"RHEA|1|Follow the smoke back. The fire's by the ambulance.":["common",261501,19245,3168],"RHEA|1|Listen for the towers. One's west, past that blue scar. One's east, out by the dead tree. One's north.":["common",280746,38253,6336],"RHEA|1|Follow the beams north. To the stones.":["common",318999,14637,2400],"RHEA|1|East. Where the trees go black.":["common",333636,11757,1920],"RHEA|1|North. Toward the white light.":["common",345393,10749,1752],"RHEA|1|That one won't be the last.":["intro",1493460,9741,1584],"RHEA|1|There's weather coming. I can hear it on the radio, rolling in from the north.":["intro",1503201,26301,4344],"YOU|0|How long?":["intro",1529502,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Long enough to find things that burn. Food. Water. Go.":["intro",1536651,22413,3696],"YOU|0|You always say that.":["intro",1559064,9597,1560],"RHEA|1|Do I?":["intro",1568661,5997,960],"RHEA|1|{name}, the rift went wild when the Warden fell. It's spitting Hollow out of the sky, and I can't reach you before dark.":["night",563313,41565,6888],"RHEA|1|The fire pit by the ambulance. Somebody built it for you. Light it. Stay in the light.":["night",604878,30765,5088],"RHEA|1|First night out here. Keep the fire burning. Whatever comes out of the dark, it hates the light.":["night",635643,31917,5280],"RHEA|1|I found tracks by the river. Bare feet. Dozens of them. Heading your way.":["night",667560,26301,4344],"RHEA|1|I keep hearing my name in the static. In my own voice. That's normal, right?":["night",693861,26589,4392],"YOU|0|Totally normal.":["night",720450,8877,1440],"RHEA|1|You're a terrible liar.":["night",729327,9021,1464],"RHEA|1|The second moon looks bigger tonight. Tell me I'm wrong.":["night",738348,19101,3144],"YOU|0|You're wrong.":["night",757449,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Liar.":["night",764598,5853,936],"RHEA|1|Something big is walking toward your fire. Something that used to be the Warden.":["night",770451,26445,4368],"RHEA|1|I tried to walk to you today. Six hours. I ended up right where I started.":["night",796896,26733,4416],"RHEA|1|If I stop answering, keep the fire lit anyway. Promise me.":["night",823629,22557,3720],"YOU|0|Promise.":["night",846186,6573,1056],"RHEA|1|The Hollow are learning. They watched you fight last night.":["night",852759,18237,3000],"CHOIR|0|Ten thousand and one. Stop counting the nights. We stopped long ago.":["night",870996,55245,9168],"YOU|0|Their fire's lit.":["intro",1574658,8877,1440],"RHEA|1|Is that another survivor?":["intro",1583535,9597,1560],"YOU|0|There's nobody here.":["intro",1593132,9453,1536],"YOU|0|That's my pack.":["intro",1602585,8589,1392],"YOU|0|I don't remember putting it down.":["intro",1611174,12621,2064],"RHEA|1|It worked, the signal jumped! And there's something riding underneath it. Voices.":["story",686364,26589,4392],"YOU|0|Tell me you heard that.":["story",712953,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|I heard it. I really wish I hadn't. Keep going.":["story",722838,16941,2784],"YOU|0|Rhea, are you there?":["story",739779,9309,1512],"RHEA|1|...I'm here.":["story",749088,6141,984],"YOU|0|Where?":["story",755229,5709,912],"RHEA|1|{name}, I need to tell you something before I lose my nerve.":["story",760938,20541,3384],"YOU|0|That's never a good start.":["story",781479,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|My orders weren't to keep you alive. They were to keep you asleep. Until we landed.":["story",792804,26445,4368],"YOU|0|Landed where?":["story",819249,8301,1344],"RHEA|1|I think they meant here.":["story",827550,9021,1464],"WARDEN|0|Who rings my towers?":["story",836571,14493,2376],"RHEA|1|All three beams point north. To that stone circle.":["story",851064,18381,3024],"YOU|0|Something's waiting there.":["story",869445,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|Something's been waiting there a very long time.":["story",879330,15213,2496],"HOLLOW|0|No! No, the towers wake him!":["story",894543,19245,3168],"RHEA|1|You're breaking up. Your radio's dying.":["intro",1623795,14205,2328],"YOU|0|Then I'll find it something to eat.":["intro",1638000,13629,2232],"RHEA|1|How far are you?":["intro",1651629,7869,1272],"YOU|0|I don't know.":["intro",1659498,8157,1320],"RHEA|1|Then you're farther than you should be.":["intro",1667655,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|Is the fire still going?":["intro",1678980,9741,1584],"YOU|0|For now.":["intro",1688721,7293,1176],"RHEA|1|Make it longer than for now.":["intro",1696014,9885,1608],"RHEA|1|What have you got?":["intro",1705899,7293,1176],"YOU|0|Tins. Water. Somebody's socks.":["intro",1713192,14061,2304],"RHEA|1|Keep the tins.":["intro",1727253,7149,1152],"YOU|0|A Meridian crate. Somebody dropped this out here on purpose.":["intro",1734402,25149,4152],"YOU|0|Rhea. There's a record for me.":["intro",1759551,11613,1896],"RHEA|1|That's not possible. They don't assign a number until":["intro",1771164,17661,2904],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Dated three days before we took off.":["intro",1788825,29613,4896],"RHEA|1|I'm here. I signed off on ten thousand myself. There was no one after.":["intro",1818438,26301,4344],"YOU|0|Then who wrote me in?":["intro",1844739,9165,1488],"RHEA|1|It's handwritten. Isn't it.":["intro",1853904,10605,1728],"YOU|0|How did you know that?":["intro",1864509,9741,1584],"RHEA|1|Stay by the fire. Please. Just stay by the fire.":["intro",1874250,18525,3048],"YOU|0|Rhea.":["intro",1892775,5565,888],"RHEA|1|What? What's wrong?":["intro",1898340,7725,1248],"YOU|0|Look up.":["intro",1906065,6573,1056],"RHEA|1|Okay. That's two moons.":["intro",1912638,10173,1656],"YOU|0|Two moons.":["intro",1922811,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|I counted. Three times. Still two.":["intro",1929960,15069,2472],"RHEA|1|Panic later. The black box has its own battery. If it's still sending, someone might hear. Get to the wreck.":["intro",1945029,36669,6072],"TEO|0|Another one walking in on their own feet. That's twice this year.":["late",1370106,27453,4536],"INES|0|Teo, this is ten thousand and one.":["late",1397559,13341,2184],"TEO|0|No. There's no such number.":["late",1410900,16509,2712],"YOU|0|That's what everyone keeps telling me.":["late",1427409,14637,2400],"RHEA|1|{name}, is that you breathing like that?":["intro",1981698,13917,2280],"YOU|0|Like what?":["intro",1995615,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Nothing. It's the static. Must be the static.":["intro",2002764,16509,2712],"YOU|0|Something scratched the side of the ambulance.":["intro",2019273,16221,2664],"RHEA|1|Scratched, or wrote?":["intro",2035494,8301,1344],"YOU|0|Tally marks. Hundreds of them.":["intro",2043795,14637,2400],"YOU|0|And one word under all of them. Hundred.":["intro",2058432,18237,3000],"RHEA|1|Keep moving.":["intro",2076669,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Rhea. There's someone standing by the wreck.":["intro",2083674,15213,2496],"RHEA|1|A survivor? Wave at them.":["intro",2098887,11181,1824],"YOU|0|They're gone.":["intro",2110068,7437,1200],"YOU|0|Footprints. Bare feet.":["intro",2117505,10461,1704],"RHEA|1|Ours?":["intro",2127966,5853,936],"YOU|0|Nobody on that plane walked out barefoot.":["intro",2133819,15933,2616],"YOU|0|They go around the ambulance. All the way around. Like someone was checking on me.":["intro",2149752,31773,5256],"HOLLOW|0|Nurse?":["intro",2181525,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Here it comes. Stay by the fire, {name}. Whatever you hear out there, it isn't":["intro",2188674,27165,4488],"RHEA|1|The storm's coming in again. It only ever starts when you wake up.":["intro",2215839,22413,3696],"YOU|0|When I wake up?":["intro",2238252,8877,1440],"RHEA|1|That isn't what I meant.":["intro",2247129,9165,1488],"YOU|0|I need more than what's lying around. Fuel. Medicine.":["intro",2256294,23565,3888],"RHEA|1|There's a light on the path toward the old camp. A lantern. It isn't mine.":["intro",2279859,25437,4200],"YOU|0|Somebody else is out here?":["intro",2305296,12045,1968],"YOU|0|Meridian surplus. Somebody's chalked prices on the lids.":["intro",2317341,24429,4032],"YOU|0|Fire axe. Okay. Okay, I can do fire axe.":["intro",2341770,21837,3600],"RHEA|1|Good. Now the doors. Kick them like they owe you money.":["intro",2363607,18237,3000],"YOU|0|Rhea. Something's watching me. It's not one of them.":["common",356142,20541,3384],"RHEA|1|Not a Hollow?":["common",376683,7005,1128],"YOU|0|No mask. No wristband. No face, really.":["common",383688,19965,3288],"RHEA|1|Then it was here before any of us. Back away slow. Find a fire if you can.":["common",403653,26589,4392],"TRADER|0|You look better than last time.":["intro",2381844,14925,2448],"YOU|0|Last time?":["intro",2396769,8157,1320],"TRADER|0|Hm? Never mind me.":["intro",2404926,13773,2256],"TRADER|0|Watch my hands. I'll only do it once.":["intro",2418699,17517,2880],"TRADER|0|Fair.":["intro",2436216,7149,1152],"TRADER|0|That'll keep you a while.":["intro",2443365,12765,2088],"TRADER|0|Spend it before it spends you.":["intro",2456130,15069,2472],"YOU|0|There's someone at that table.":["intro",2471199,11325,1848],"TRADER|0|Sit if you want. Pay for what you touch.":["intro",2482524,16797,2760],"YOU|0|Pay with what?":["intro",2499321,7437,1200],"TRADER|0|Shards. Same as everyone.":["intro",2506758,13773,2256],"RHEA|1|Who's that with you?":["intro",2520531,7725,1248],"YOU|0|Somebody selling medkits.":["intro",2528256,11325,1848],"RHEA|1|Then buy one.":["intro",2539581,7149,1152],"RHEA|1|Sleeper? Oh, thank God. Tap the radio if you can hear me. Anything.":["intro",2546730,24717,4080],"YOU|0|I'm here. I think. Where's here?":["intro",2571447,12909,2112],"RHEA|1|{name}. That's what your wristband says. Hi, {name}. I'm Rhea. I've been talking to you for six hours and you never once talked back.":["intro",2584356,39405,6528],"YOU|0|Sorry. I was unconscious.":["intro",2623761,12333,2016],"RHEA|1|Excuses. And stop picking at the wristband. You always pick at it.":["intro",2636094,23997,3960],"YOU|0|Always?":["intro",2660091,7437,1200],"RHEA|1|You picked at it the whole flight. Listen. I got thrown clear. My leg's fine. ...It's not fine. I'm moving.":["intro",2667528,39981,6624],"RHEA|1|That smell is fuel. Find something heavy and get out of that box before it decides to become a fireball.":["intro",2707509,36525,6048],"RHEA|1|You went quiet for a minute there.":["intro",2744034,10605,1728],"YOU|0|I was out. I think.":["intro",2754639,10317,1680],"RHEA|1|Careful past the big rock this time.":["intro",2764956,13197,2160],"YOU|0|This time?":["intro",2778153,7293,1176],"RHEA|1|I don't know why I said that.":["intro",2785446,10605,1728],"YOU|0|Somebody's fed the fire.":["intro",2796051,11613,1896],"RHEA|1|Well, it wasn't me.":["intro",2807664,8157,1320],"RHEA|1|Welcome back.":["intro",2815821,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Back from where?":["intro",2822682,8301,1344],"RHEA|1|I meant to the fire. Didn't I?":["intro",2830983,11901,1944],"WARDEN|0|Patient One. Discharged.":["story",913788,16509,2712],"WARDEN|0|You think the sky saved you? The sky ate you!":["story",930297,23133,3816],"WARDEN|0|Ten thousand.":["story",953430,10461,1704],"WARDEN|0|No.":["story",963891,7293,1176],"WARDEN|0|Ten thousand. And one?":["story",971184,14925,2448],"WARDEN|0|You're not the one I was expecting.":["story",986109,17229,2832],"YOU|0|Who were you expecting?":["story",1003338,10461,1704],"WARDEN|0|The last one. They promised me the last one. I was the first. I have counted every one of them down.":["story",1013799,45021,7464],"WARDEN|0|There is no one after the last. So what are you?":["story",1058820,23997,3960],"RHEA|1|{name}, the red ring! When it glows, jump or run!":["story",1082817,19245,3168],"WARDEN|0|I remember rain. Real rain. Cold, on my face.":["story",1102062,29469,4872],"WARDEN|0|Children! Hold the one I didn't count!":["story",1131531,17373,2856],"HOLLOW|0|And one.":["intro",2842884,8157,1320],"YOU|0|Who's there?":["intro",2851041,7149,1152],"YOU|0|Wristbands. Hundreds of them, nailed up in rows.":["late",1442046,20253,3336],"INES|0|Everyone who makes it here leaves theirs. It's how we stop being numbers.":["late",1462299,24573,4056],"YOU|0|There's one here with my number on it.":["late",1486872,14205,2328],"INES|0|That's not possible.":["late",1501077,9309,1512],"YOU|0|The plastic's gone yellow. It's been here for years.":["late",1510386,20829,3432],"INES|0|Teo's going to want to see that.":["late",1531215,11613,1896],"WARDEN|0|I was the first. I will be the last thing you see. Again.":["night",926241,28605,4728],"RHEA|1|{name}! Stay down, breathe. I'm talking you back up.":["night",954846,18813,3096],"WARDEN|0|Patient One. Discharged. Again.":["night",973659,20109,3312],"RHEA|1|Here they come. Stay near the fire!":["night",993768,12477,2040],"RHEA|1|Rift's opening. Hold the light, {name}!":["night",1006245,14493,2376],"RHEA|1|I can hear them from here. Fire. Now.":["night",1020738,15069,2472],"YOU|0|They came from the wreck last time. They'll come from the wreck again.":["night",1035807,23565,3888],"YOU|0|They came from the Blackwood last time. They'll come from the Blackwood again.":["night",1059372,26589,4392],"YOU|0|They came from the mast last time. They'll come from the mast again.":["night",1085961,25725,4248],"YOU|0|They came from the field station last time. They'll come from the field station again.":["night",1111686,31917,5280],"YOU|0|They came from the stone circle last time. They'll come from the stone circle again.":["night",1143603,30765,5088],"YOU|0|If anything walks into that, I'll hear it.#b":["intro",2858190,14205,2328],"YOU|0|Someone's following me. It's me. A few seconds behind.#b":["late",1542828,20829,3432],"YOU|0|Rhea, the rocks are floating.#b":["late",1563657,9741,1584],"YOU|0|I'm walking into it.#b":["late",1573398,8733,1416],"YOU|0|Rhea. Did you know?#b":["intro",2872395,7437,1200],"YOU|0|How much of it?#b":["intro",2879832,7437,1200],"YOU|0|Black box. It's still got power. There's a recording.#b":["intro",2887269,18525,3048],"YOU|0|Stones round it. It'll hold the heat now.#b":["intro",2905794,15069,2472],"YOU|0|Somewhere to keep things. Somewhere that stays put.#b":["intro",2920863,17661,2904],"YOU|0|A roof. More or less.#b":["intro",2938524,9453,1536],"YOU|0|First time it's felt like I'm staying.#b":["intro",2947977,12765,2088],"YOU|0|Clean cloth. Needle. Everything laid out in the right order.#b":["intro",2960742,21837,3600],"YOU|0|I don't remember learning the right order.#b":["intro",2982579,12765,2088],"YOU|0|Rhea. Is that better?#b":["intro",2995344,8445,1368],"YOU|0|Built a radio out of a broken one.#b":["intro",3003789,13485,2208],"YOU|0|Everything I've found, in one place.#b":["intro",3017274,13197,2160],"YOU|0|Some of these pencil marks were here already. Same hand as mine.#b":["intro",3030471,24573,4056],"YOU|0|Still there?#b":["intro",3055044,6285,1008],"YOU|0|Talk to me about anything.#b":["intro",3061329,9597,1560],"YOU|0|It's my second day too.#b":["story",1148904,9885,1608],"YOU|0|Nothing. I'm coming back.#b":["story",1158789,9741,1584],"YOU|0|It's pointed at the crash.#b":["story",1168530,9309,1512],"YOU|0|Somebody's been watching us.#b":["story",1177839,10749,1752],"YOU|0|It started recording at two fifty-one.#b":["story",1188588,13629,2232],"YOU|0|We came down at twelve minutes past three.#b":["story",1202217,13917,2280],"YOU|0|It's behind me. It isn't trying to catch up.#b":["story",1216134,16077,2640],"YOU|0|Seeing where I go.#b":["story",1232211,8013,1296],"YOU|0|I walked right past here this morning.#b":["story",1240224,12765,2088],"YOU|0|Rhea? Where are you?#b":["story",1252989,7725,1248],"YOU|0|I just heard you. Out there, in the trees.#b":["story",1260714,15069,2472],"YOU|0|Rhea?#b":["story",1275783,4989,792],"YOU|0|Rhea. Say something.#b":["story",1280772,8301,1344],"YOU|0|Prints. All the way round the fire.#b":["story",1289073,11757,1920],"YOU|0|Bare feet. It stopped every few steps. Like it was listening.#b":["story",1300830,22845,3768],"YOU|0|Then it went that way.#b":["story",1323675,8157,1320],"YOU|0|It knows where I sleep. I want to know where it goes.#b":["story",1331832,18525,3048],"YOU|0|That's not her.#b":["story",1350357,7149,1152],"YOU|0|It's close. It's coming from out there.#b":["story",1357506,13341,2184],"YOU|0|I'm here.#b":["story",1370847,5853,936],"YOU|0|Somebody filmed the crash, Rhea. From before it happened.#b":["story",1376700,19533,3216],"YOU|0|Then somebody knew.#b":["story",1396233,7869,1272],"YOU|0|She said you dropped her off.#b":["late",1582131,10317,1680],"YOU|0|Were they?#b":["late",1592448,5565,888],"YOU|0|I'm keeping it. If it's a key, I want to know what it opens.#b":["late",1598013,21117,3480],"YOU|0|{name}. Not ten thousand and one. Just {name}.#b":["late",1619130,20253,3336],"YOU|0|I'm still going north.#b":["late",1639383,9741,1584],"YOU|0|Stones. Kindling. Dry wood.#b":["late",1649124,12189,1992],"YOU|0|Right next to where I woke up.#b":["late",1661313,10029,1632],"YOU|0|Why?#b":["late",1671342,5133,816],"YOU|0|Who are you?#b":["late",1676475,6573,1056],"YOU|0|Then what happens now?#b":["late",1683048,8877,1440],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Flight, the fourteenth of March.#b":["late",1691925,24141,3984],"YOU|0|It was my handwriting. The whole time.#b":["late",1716066,14493,2376],"YOU|0|Rhea. You told me nobody was going anywhere tonight.#b":["late",1730559,18093,2976],"YOU|0|You will.#b":["late",1748652,5565,888],"YOU|0|Every time.#b":["late",1754217,6573,1056],"YOU|0|They're going back into the trees.#b":["intro",3070926,10749,1752],"YOU|0|Still here.#b":["night",1174368,6285,1008],"YOU|0|It isn't quiet. Something keeps walking just past the light.#b":["intro",3081675,21261,3504],"YOU|0|There's something out here worth finding.#b":["intro",3102936,12909,2112],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. {name}. If you're hearing this, it's already happened. I've done this before. Many times.#b":["echo",558717,35517,5880],"YOU|0|I built the fire. I carried the case to it. I wrote us into the book, so you'd know you were expected.#b":["echo",594234,35949,5952],"YOU|0|Stop counting the nights. Start counting the people. Find Rhea.#b":["echo",630183,23709,3912],"YOU|0|Me.#b":["echo",653892,4989,792],"YOU|0|I know.#b":["late",1760790,7005,1128],"YOU|0|Someone built a fire pit. Stones, kindling, dry wood. Right next to where I woke up.#b":["intro",3115845,32205,5328],"YOU|0|There's a case by the stones. Meridian. Somebody carried it here from the wreck.#b":["intro",3148050,27741,4584],"YOU|0|It's already open.#b":["intro",3175791,7869,1272],"YOU|0|It's out. I need something that burns.#b":["intro",3183660,13629,2232],"YOU|0|It's wearing a wristband. Twenty two ninety one.#b":["intro",3197289,17373,2856],"YOU|0|Then why was it walking?#b":["intro",3214662,9309,1512],"YOU|0|You knew I'd make it.#b":["intro",3223971,8733,1416],"YOU|0|It's warm. And it's humming.#b":["intro",3232704,9885,1608],"YOU|0|Rhea. Someone's standing in the trees.#b":["intro",3242589,12765,2088],"YOU|0|Nothing. They're gone.#b":["intro",3255354,8589,1392],"YOU|0|You've got a wristband.#b":["late",1767795,8445,1368],"YOU|0|That he stops trying to kill me?#b":["late",1776240,10893,1776],"YOU|0|Rhea. I died. I felt it.#b":["night",1180653,10893,1776],"YOU|0|Then why do I remember the dark?#b":["night",1191546,11613,1896],"YOU|0|Same moons. Same smoke. Same fire.#b":["night",1203159,16365,2688],"YOU|0|Good. Stay scared. It keeps you alive.#b":["night",1219524,13773,2256],"YOU|0|I know. I always know what you're going to say.#b":["night",1233297,15069,2472],"YOU|0|Differently.#b":["night",1248366,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Again. The shards remember. So do I.#b":["night",1254795,14349,2352],"YOU|0|Somebody's cut a mark into this tree.#b":["intro",3263943,12765,2088],"YOU|0|It's fresh.#b":["intro",3276708,5997,960],"YOU|0|Wristbands on the stones by the fire. Mine. More of them every time.#b":["night",1269144,26733,4416],"YOU|0|That cairn wasn't here last time.#b":["night",1295877,11613,1896],"YOU|0|Never mind.#b":["night",1307490,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Then I'll find you.#b":["night",1314351,8013,1296],"YOU|0|There's a page by the fire. The registry. My line.#b":["night",1322364,19245,3168],"YOU|0|Still wet.#b":["night",1341609,6429,1032],"YOU|0|Someone at the edge of the light again.#b":["night",1348038,12909,2112],"YOU|0|I think it's always the same one.#b":["night",1360947,11469,1872],"YOU|0|They're waiting to see if I remember.#b":["night",1372416,12765,2088],"YOU|0|That tree was standing yesterday. Or whenever yesterday was.#b":["night",1385181,21981,3624],"YOU|0|I understand it now. It isn't punishing me. It's waiting for me to build the fire.#b":["night",1407162,30621,5064],"YOU|0|How long?#b":["intro",3282705,6141,984],"YOU|0|You always say that.#b":["intro",3288846,8157,1320],"YOU|0|Totally normal.#b":["night",1437783,7005,1128],"YOU|0|You're wrong.#b":["night",1444788,5997,960],"YOU|0|Promise.#b":["night",1450785,5853,936],"YOU|0|Their fire's lit.#b":["intro",3297003,7869,1272],"YOU|0|There's nobody here.#b":["intro",3304872,7869,1272],"YOU|0|That's my pack.#b":["intro",3312741,7437,1200],"YOU|0|I don't remember putting it down.#b":["intro",3320178,11325,1848],"YOU|0|Tell me you heard that.#b":["story",1404102,8445,1368],"YOU|0|Rhea, are you there?#b":["story",1412547,7581,1224],"YOU|0|Where?#b":["story",1420128,4989,792],"YOU|0|That's never a good start.#b":["story",1425117,9741,1584],"YOU|0|Landed where?#b":["story",1434858,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Something's waiting there.#b":["story",1441719,9165,1488],"YOU|0|Then I'll find it something to eat.#b":["intro",3331503,11901,1944],"YOU|0|I don't know.#b":["intro",3343404,6573,1056],"YOU|0|For now.#b":["intro",3349977,5997,960],"YOU|0|Tins. Water. Somebody's socks.#b":["intro",3355974,12621,2064],"YOU|0|A Meridian crate. Somebody dropped this out here on purpose.#b":["intro",3368595,22125,3648],"YOU|0|Rhea. There's a record for me.#b":["intro",3390720,10173,1656],"YOU|0|Ten thousand and one. Active. Dated three days before we took off.#b":["intro",3400893,26733,4416],"YOU|0|Then who wrote me in?#b":["intro",3427626,8301,1344],"YOU|0|How did you know that?#b":["intro",3435927,8445,1368],"YOU|0|Rhea.#b":["intro",3444372,4989,792],"YOU|0|Look up.#b":["intro",3449361,5853,936],"YOU|0|Two moons.#b":["intro",3455214,6285,1008],"YOU|0|That's what everyone keeps telling me.#b":["late",1787133,12189,1992],"YOU|0|Like what?#b":["intro",3461499,6141,984],"YOU|0|Something scratched the side of the ambulance.#b":["intro",3467640,14205,2328],"YOU|0|Tally marks. Hundreds of them.#b":["intro",3481845,12477,2040],"YOU|0|And one word under all of them. Hundred.#b":["intro",3494322,15069,2472],"YOU|0|Rhea. There's someone standing by the wreck.#b":["intro",3509391,13341,2184],"YOU|0|They're gone.#b":["intro",3522732,6141,984],"YOU|0|Footprints. Bare feet.#b":["intro",3528873,10029,1632],"YOU|0|Nobody on that plane walked out barefoot.#b":["intro",3538902,13917,2280],"YOU|0|They go around the ambulance. All the way around. Like someone was checking on me.#b":["intro",3552819,28461,4704],"YOU|0|When I wake up?#b":["intro",3581280,7149,1152],"YOU|0|I need more than what's lying around. Fuel. Medicine.#b":["intro",3588429,20829,3432],"YOU|0|Somebody else is out here?#b":["intro",3609258,10317,1680],"YOU|0|Meridian surplus. Somebody's chalked prices on the lids.#b":["intro",3619575,21981,3624],"YOU|0|Fire axe. Okay. Okay, I can do fire axe.#b":["intro",3641556,20397,3360],"YOU|0|Rhea. Something's watching me. It's not one of them.#b":["common",430242,17661,2904],"YOU|0|No mask. No wristband. No face, really.#b":["common",447903,18525,3048],"YOU|0|Last time?#b":["intro",3661953,6573,1056],"YOU|0|There's someone at that table.#b":["intro",3668526,10749,1752],"YOU|0|Pay with what?#b":["intro",3679275,6717,1080],"YOU|0|Somebody selling medkits.#b":["intro",3685992,10317,1680],"YOU|0|I'm here. I think. Where's here?#b":["intro",3696309,10461,1704],"YOU|0|Sorry. I was unconscious.#b":["intro",3706770,10749,1752],"YOU|0|Always?#b":["intro",3717519,5853,936],"YOU|0|I was out. I think.#b":["intro",3723372,8589,1392],"YOU|0|This time?#b":["intro",3731961,5997,960],"YOU|0|Somebody's fed the fire.#b":["intro",3737958,9741,1584],"YOU|0|Back from where?#b":["intro",3747699,6861,1104],"YOU|0|Who were you expecting?#b":["story",1450884,8301,1344],"YOU|0|Who's there?#b":["intro",3754560,5997,960],"YOU|0|Wristbands. Hundreds of them, nailed up in rows.#b":["late",1799322,18381,3024],"YOU|0|There's one here with my number on it.#b":["late",1817703,12909,2112],"YOU|0|The plastic's gone yellow. It's been here for years.#b":["late",1830612,18813,3096],"YOU|0|They came from the wreck last time. They'll come from the wreck again.#b":["night",1456638,21693,3576],"YOU|0|They came from the Blackwood last time. They'll come from the Blackwood again.#b":["night",1478331,23997,3960],"YOU|0|They came from the mast last time. They'll come from the mast again.#b":["night",1502328,23133,3816],"YOU|0|They came from the field station last time. They'll come from the field station again.#b":["night",1525461,28605,4728],"YOU|0|They came from the stone circle last time. They'll come from the stone circle again.#b":["night",1554066,27741,4584]}